n_ref, net10 --> sub --> net4
net4 --> scaler(1/Tref) --> tf([1-var_a],[1,-var_a],1) --> net12
net12, net16 --> add --> net17

net17, net20 --> sub --> net18
net18 --> tf([adc_ff_gain],[1,-1],1) --> net19
net14 --> scaler(adc_fb_gain) --> net20

net19 --> comparator --> net14



net14, net13 --> add --> net5
net5 --> scaler(Kp) --> tf([1-var_c],[1,-var_c],1) --> net6

net5 --> tf([Ki, 0],[1,-1],1) --> net7
net6, net7 --> add --> net8


net8, mash_o --> up_zoh_multi --> net9
